      "content": "76. Proportional tax has uniform rate."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "wp9mr6m",
      "content": "77. Budget is annual financial statement."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "3518o9g",
      "content": "78. Capital expenditure creates assets."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
